a9be432591d3b5.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hunna", "arabic": "يَسْتَقِمْنَ", "plain": "يَسْتَقِمْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/500c4ecae62218dca3d5.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "arabic": "ٱسْتَقِمْ", "plain": "اِسْتَقِمْ", "quran": true, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/8c21e27ce7df24856184.m4a", "recited": "audio/6f8f198e252eacef5aaf.m4a", "recitedText": "فَٱسْتَقِمْ"}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anti", "arabic": "اِسْتَقِيمِي", "plain": "اِسْتَقِيمِي", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/e1f425855c644610cde4.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "arabic": "اِسْتَقِيمَا", "plain": "اِسْتَقِيمَا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/651163a72374fef79d2e.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "arabic": "ٱسْتَقِيمُوا۟", "plain": "اِسْتَقِيمُوا", "quran": true, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/f69606644ce0bcab183e.m4a", "recited": "audio/8f704877a838a7de7e4c.m4a", "recitedText": "فَٱسْتَقِيمُوا۟"}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "اِسْتَقِمْنَ", "plain": "اِسْتَقِمْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/ae6261c58eecddee4198.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "72:16", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5463.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "If they (the idolaters) tread the right path, We shall give them to drink of water in abundance", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Onlar gerçekten o yol üzere dosdoğru gitselerdi, elbette kendilerine bol bir su verirdik.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور فرماؤ کہ مجھے یہ وحی ہوئی ہے کہ اگر وہ راہ پر سیدھے رہتے تو ضرور ہم انہیں وافر پانی دیتے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan bahwasanya: jikalau mereka tetap berjalan lurus di atas jalan itu (agama Islam), benar-benar Kami akan memberi minum kepada mereka air yang segar (rezeki yang banyak).", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَأَلَّوِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱسْتَقَٰمُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/5151dfa6d5a50622a2c2.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "da su ustrajali", "en": "they had kept straight", "tr": "dosdoğru olsalardı", "fr": "ils s'étaient tenus droits", "id": "mereka telah istikamah", "ur": "اگر وہ سیدھے رہتے", "bn": "তারা সোজা পথে ছিল", "fa": "استوار ماندند"}}, {"text": "عَلَى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلطَّرِيقَةِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَأَسْقَيْنَٰهُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَّآءً", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "غَدَقًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "11:112", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1585.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "So tread thou the straight path as thou art commanded, and those who turn (unto Allah) with thee, and transgress not. Lo! He is Seer of what ye do.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "İşte bundan dolayı emrolunduğun gibi doğru ol! Beraberindeki tevbe edenler de (doğru olsunlar). Aşırı gitmeyin! Muhakkak ki O, bütün yaptıklarınızı görüp durmaktadır.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو قائم رہو جیسا تمہیں حکم ہے اور جو تمہارے ساتھ رجوع لایا ہے اور اے لوگو! سرکشی نہ کرو بیشک وہ تمہارے کام دیکھ رہا ہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka tetaplah kamu pada jalan yang benar, sebagaimana diperintahkan kepadamu dan (juga) orang yang telah taubat beserta kamu dan janganlah kamu melampaui batas. Sesungguhnya Dia Maha Melihat apa yang kamu kerjakan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَٱسْتَقِمْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/6f8f198e252eacef5aaf.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "so be upright!", "bs": "pa ustraj!", "tr": "sebat et!", "fr": "alors tiens bon !", "id": "maka teguhlah!", "ur": "پس سیدھے رہو!", "bn": "অতএব অটল থাক!", "fa": "پس پایداری کن!"}}, {"text": "كَمَآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أُمِرْتَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَمَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَابَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَعَكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَطْغَوْا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِنَّهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَعْمَلُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بَصِيرٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "10:89", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1453.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "He said: Your prayer is heard. Do ye twain keep to the straight path, and follow not the road of those who have no knowledge.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Allah buyurdu: \"Her ikinizin de duası kesinlikle kabul olundu. Siz yine doğru ve dürüst olmaya devam edin. Kendini bilmeyenlerin yoluna sakın uymayın.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "فرمایا تم دونوں کی دعا قبول ہوئی تو ثابت قدم رہو اور نادانوں کی راہ نہ چلو", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "AlIah berfirman: \"Sesungguhnya telah diperkenankan permohonan kamu berdua, sebab itu tetaplah kamu berdua pada jalan yang lurus dan janganlah sekali-kali kamu mengikuti jalan orang-orang yang tidak mengetahui\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قَدْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أُجِيبَت", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "دَّعْوَتُكُمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَٱسْتَقِيمَا", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/a7aaa6717037133d7d54.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa ustrajte", "en": "so keep straight (you two)", "tr": "öyleyse dosdoğru olun", "fr": "alors tenez-vous droits (vous deux)", "id": "maka istikamahlah (kalian berdua)", "ur": "پس دونوں سیدھے رہو", "bn": "অতএব তোমরা (দুজন) সোজা পথে থাকো", "fa": "پس استوار بمانید (شما دو نفر)"}}, {"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَتَّبِعَآنِّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سَبِيلَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "81:28", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5828.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Unto whomsoever of you willeth to walk straight.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "İçinizden doğru gitmek isteyenler için.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اس کے لیے جو تم میں سیدھا ہونا چاہے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "(yaitu) bagi siapa di antara kamu yang mau menempuh jalan yang lurus.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "لِمَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "شَآءَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِنكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَسْتَقِيمَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/b6818a11c97dedab2e68.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "da bude na pravom putu", "en": "to go straight", "tr": "dosdoğru olması için", "fr": "aller droit", "id": "untuk istikamah", "ur": "کہ وہ سیدھا چلے", "bn": "সোজা পথে চলতে", "fa": "که استوار بماند"}}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "ٱسْتَقَٰمُوا۟", "count": 4, "first": "9:7", "audio": "audio/5151dfa6d5a50622a2c2.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "da su ustrajali", "en": "they had kept straight", "tr": "dosdoğru olsalardı", "fr": "ils s'étaient tenus droits", "id": "mereka telah istikamah", "ur": "اگر وہ سیدھے رہتے", "bn": "তারা সোজা পথে ছিল", "fa": "استوار ماندند"}}, {"arabic": "فَٱسْتَقِيمُوا۟", "count": 1, "first": "9:7", "audio": "audio/8f704877a838a7de7e4c.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "so (you all) be upright!", "bs": "pa ustrajte!", "tr": "sebat edin!", "fr": "alors tenez bon !", "id": "maka teguhlah kalian!", "ur": "پس سیدھے رہو!", "bn": "অতএব তোমরা অটল থাক!", "fa": "پس پایداری کنید!"}}, {"arabic": "فَٱسْتَقِيمَا", "count": 1, "first": "10:89", "audio": "audio/a7aaa6717037133d7d54.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "passive": false, "objects": ["antuma"]}], "gloss": {"bs": "pa ustrajte", "en": "so keep straight (you two)", "tr": "öyleyse dosdoğru olun", "fr": "alors tenez-vous droits (vous deux)", "id": "maka istikamahlah (kalian berdua)", "ur": "پس دونوں سیدھے رہو", "bn": "অতএব তোমরা (দুজন) সোজা পথে থাকো", "fa": "پس استوار بمانید (شما دو نفر)"}}, {"arabic": "فَٱسْتَقِمْ", "count": 1, "first": "11:112", "audio": "audio/6f8f198e252eacef5aaf.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "so be upright!", "bs": "pa ustraj!", "tr": "sebat et!", "fr": "alors tiens bon !", "id": "maka teguhlah!", "ur": "پس سیدھے رہو!", "bn": "অতএব অটল থাক!", "fa": "پس پایداری کن!"}}, {"arabic": "فَٱسْتَقِيمُوٓا۟", "count": 1, "first": "41:6", "audio": "audio/e0650a0f16d2c0a32a4b.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "so (you all) be upright!", "bs": "pa ustrajte!", "tr": "sebat edin!", "fr": "alors tenez bon !", "id": "maka teguhlah kalian!", "ur": "پس تم سب سیدھے رہو!", "bn": "অতএব তোমরা অটল থাক!", "fa": "پس پایداری کنید!"}}, {"arabic": "وَٱسْتَقِمْ", "count": 1, "first": "42:15", "audio": "audio/0e2e6c5c04bad0bd7cd3.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "and be upright!", "bs": "i ustraj!", "tr": "ve sebat et!", "fr": "et tiens bon !", "id": "dan teguhlah!", "ur": "اور سیدھے رہو!", "bn": "এবং অটল থাক!", "fa": "و پایداری کن!"}}, {"arabic": "يَسْتَقِيمَ", "count": 1, "first": "81:28", "audio": "audio/b6818a11c97dedab2e68.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "subjunctive"}], "gloss": {"bs": "da bude na pravom putu", "en": "to go straight", "tr": "dosdoğru olması için", "fr": "aller droit", "id": "untuk istikamah", "ur": "کہ وہ سیدھا چلے", "bn": "সোজা পথে চলতে", "fa": "که استوار بماند"}}], "ayatFile": "ayat/0307.json", "ayatTranslations": {"en": "ayat/0307.en.json", "tr": "ayat/0307.tr.json", "ur": "ayat/0307.ur.json", "id": "ayat/0307.id.json"}, "sentences": [{"arabic": "اِسْتَقَامُوا فِي عَمَلِهِمْ", "spoken": "audio/969d8e645633aa8d84b9.m4a", "tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "translation": {"bs": "Bili su pošteni u svom poslu.", "en": "They were upright in their work.", "bn": "তারা তাদের কাজে সৎ ও সরল ছিল।", "fa": "در کارشان استوار بودند.", "fr": "Ils